      "unitNumber": 4,
      "title": "Describing Functions",
      "purpose": "Students determine whether a relationship is a function and interpret statements in function notation. They compare functions using function notation and make connections between a function's multiple representations (graphs, tables, equations, and situations). They describe functions using their key features, including average rate of change, domain, and range. They interpret, evaluate, graph, and write equations of absolute value functions. They analyze and represent sequences using function notation.",
